                                "sense_id": "ef941857-ab27-345a-8220-8a88041c2023",
                                "text": "For when I recollect, singly, the particular positions upon which his opinion seems to be founded, I do not find them by any means uncontrovertible; some of them seem at best uncertain, and some evidently mistaken."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9d610016-c821-4ef3-b803-010c0b6d0e0f",
                                "sense_id": "ef941857-ab27-345a-8220-8a88041c2023",
                                "text": "Nothing that any German can ever say or write will efface from the memory of the world the uncontrovertible fact that your Chancellor officially admitted your country's guilt in this matter."
                            }
                        ]
